Update to https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes/issues/94008#issuecomment-703680713

It actually won't work properly. Either v1beta1 plugins get broken or v1beta2 configurations don't get prevented from instantiating old plugins. I believe having `getPluginArgsOrDefault` do validation is a bad idea. We should be doing that during actual API validation (or conversion? although I'm not sure if api-approvers would agree with that).

@pancernik do you have any thoughts? I know pluginconfig validation is WIP, but we haven't really discussed plugin names validation. Note that not all plugins have Args. But maybe we can just add empty ones for all of them.
